As of March 14 2014.

   - I've created a new main page. The main thing is that it allows the
   visitor to click on the flag of their native language and
      - not only the interface of the wiki will be changed to that language
      - but the user will be redirected to the welcome page in that language
      - and the left sidebar with useful links will be changed accordingly
      - http://mw.lojban.org/index.php?title=ralju_papri
   - Quiz extension for creating exercises installed
   - Wikiforum. To prevent spammers now only administrators can create new
   threads. However, even unregistered users can post to the forum. Thus we
   have a guestboard.
   - Collection extension installed allowing export of pages in nicely
   formatted pdf files.



